{1}{[A young female officer stops you before you manage to walk any further.] Excuse me, sir, you're @PCNAME@, right? I have a telegram for you. It's about your new assignment in the Yotland Scard Special Branch. [She hands you a telegram.] I think you should read it.}{[A young female officer stops you before you manage to walk any further.] Excuse me, miss, you're @PCNAME@, right? I have a telegram for you. It's about your new assignment in the Yotland Scard Special Branch. [She hands you a telegram.] I think you should read it.}{}{}{}{in -5401}
